Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

WakaBoard ships with no third-party runtime dependencies. The shipping binary
links only against frameworks provided by Apple as part of the operating system
(Foundation, SwiftUI, Swift Charts, WidgetKit, Security, and OSLog), which are
governed by the Apple SDK license and are not redistributed by this project.

XcodeGen (https://github.com/yonaskolb/XcodeGen, MIT License) is used at
development time to generate the Xcode project from `project.yml`. It is a build
tool only: no XcodeGen code is compiled into, linked against, or distributed with
WakaBoard.

